  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Friedel-Craft acylation reaction in&nbsp;benzene&nbsp;takes place. Aluminium chloride is Lewis acid which helps in generating electrophile as shown in first step of reaction.</p><p>This electrophile get substituted in benzene and product (A) is obtained. In next step, Clemmensen&#39;s reduction occur which converts aldehyde or ketone into hydrocarbon.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0075_187ca093ae1e.png\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 263px;\" /></p>"
